## Why This Is Asked
Show ability to craft concrete test cases in 3-valued logic and reason about propagation.

## Key Concepts
- Kleene three-valued semantics; - Implication as NOT X OR Y; - Constraint propagation/backtracking; - Satisfiability with NULLs in databases.

## Code Example
```javascript
function kleeneImplies(a,b){
  const not = v => v==='T'?'F':v==='F'?'T':'U';
  const or = (x,y)=> (x==='T' || y==='T')?'T':(x==='U' || y==='U')?'U':'F';
  return or(not(a), b);
}
```

